# Rule: Scroll animations & cockpit hooks

Shared scroll progress, cockpit integration, and home-v2 handoff compositing. Changes affect Lenis, GSAP, HUD behavior, and the depth-corridor cover transition.

**Read first:** `sentinel/decisions/002-scroll-animation-architecture.md`, `sentinel/decisions/005-scroll-captured-content-reveal.md`, `sentinel/decisions/018-home-v2-depth-corridor.md`.

**Process:** `sentinel/MAINTENANCE.md` - document contract changes with an ADR or decision addendum.

**Home-v2 handoff invariant:** the post-corridor swipe is an opaque incoming cover plane over a held corridor canvas. Keep the first-read services copy inside the 100svh cover, keep the docked canvas opacity at `1`, and let the cover plane do the replacement. Do not re-create this as a transparent parallax section plus a canvas fade.
